Five agents, five tabs, no idea who is stuck
One live board for every agent

4
00:00:22.953 --> 00:00:30.892
You can’t leave the desk while they run
Run them from your phone

5
00:00:31.222 --> 00:00:42.026
The same instructions every morning, and drafts that go out unchecked
Scheduled routines whose drafts wait for your OK

6
